---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy">
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <span class="section-kicker">YOUR VISIT, YOUR CHOICE</span>
    <h1>
      A note on privacy<span class="brand-dot">.</span>
    </h1>
  </section>
  <div class="article-body privacy-body">
    <p>
      This is the personal website of Vishruth Harithsa. You can read every note
      without creating an account or agreeing to analytics.
    </p>
    <h2>Analytics and site performance</h2>
    <p>
      If you choose “Allow analytics”, this site loads Google Analytics through
      Firebase (measurement ID G-VZF9P08XB9) and Dynatrace Real User Monitoring.
      These services help understand page visits, browser performance, and
      technical errors. Providers may process browser, device, network, and
      cookie identifiers according to their settings and policies.
    </p>
    <p>
      Advertising consent is denied. The site does not intentionally send search
      text, email addresses, form input, or URL query strings as custom
      analytics. It does not set an identified Dynatrace user. Session Replay is
      not enabled by this application; the owner must also keep it disabled in
      the Dynatrace application configuration.
    </p>
    <h2>Your choice</h2>
    <p>
      Your choice is stored in your browser under{" "}
      <code>harithsa.analytics.v1</code>. If browser storage is blocked, it
      applies only to the current page. You can revisit this choice below or in
      the footer. Withdrawing consent reloads the page to stop the loaded
      monitoring scripts. Existing provider cookies may remain until removed
      through browser settings; withdrawal does not delete previously collected
      data.
    </p>
    <p>
      <button class="button" data-privacy-settings>
        Manage cookie settings
      </button>
    </p>
    <h2>Display preferences</h2>
    <p>
      Your colour-mode choice is saved only in this browser. Until you choose a
      mode, the site follows your device’s light or dark preference. Clearing
      this site’s browser data resets that choice. This functional setting does
      not enable analytics. If browser storage is unavailable, you can still
      switch modes for the current page.
    </p>
    <h2>External links and images</h2>
    <p>
      Links to GitHub, LinkedIn, Topmate, and other services open their
      websites, which have their own privacy policies. Some images within
      archived articles are served by their original image providers. Requests
      to external image services disclose normal network information, including
      your IP address.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this site or a request concerning your data, contact
      me through <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/theharithsa/">LinkedIn</a>
      .
    </p>
    <p>Last updated: 6 November 2026.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
